{
  "groups": [
    {
      "reason": "Build pipeline of Tailwind (the compiler, the Vite plugin and the bundler and CSS tools they pull in): runs in Node at build time, nothing from it reaches the browser bundle. `tailwindcss` itself is not here: its CSS is inlined into the built stylesheet",
